    "canonicalization": "Trim input; parse URI; normalize dot segments; lowercase scheme and host; remove http:80/https:443; remove all trailing slash characters from raw path; omit empty path; split raw query on &, discard empty items, sort remaining raw items lexicographically and join with &, omit fragment and userinfo; SHA-256 of canonical UTF-8 bytes, lowercase hex. Reject missing scheme/host or malformed URL.",
